 (`.teaching-card-inner`) used an 18px gap across 14 child elements, creating over 250px of blank gap space alone. Each inner card had large 15–20px paddings and 16.5px text, forcing users to scroll continuously.\n* **Fix**:\n  - Ti\n<truncated 2807 bytes>\nPTION A` and `OPTION B`).\n  - As soon as the user selects a choice or clicks **Reveal Answer**, the condition gate dynamically reveals `✓ TRUE` or `✗ FALSE` along with the executing branch highlight.\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Test Results\n\nBoth regression test suites were executed:\n\n1. **Layout & Gap Verification Suite** ([`scratch/test_layout.js`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/scratch/test_layout.js)):\n   ```text\n   Checking index.html top-bar rows:\n     ✓ top-bar-primary & top-bar-secondary present\n   Checking styles.css updates:\n     ✓ styles.css tightened layout & classes present\n   Checking app.js isPredictPending logic:\n     ✓ app.js prediction neutral gate logic verified\n   ALL UI GAP ADJUSTMENT CHECKS PASSED!\n   ```\n\n2. **Phase 5 Comprehensive Audit Suite** ([`scratch/test_phase5.js`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/scratch/test_phase5.js)):\n   ```text\n   =================================================\n   PHASE 5 TEST AUDIT COMPLETE: 82/82 TESTS PASSED\n   100% OF TESTS PASSED WITH ZERO FAILURES!\n   =================================================\n   ```\n   - **Kadane Max Subarray Output**: `6` (sub-slice `[4, -1, 2, 1]`) preserved.\n   - **Navigation Integrity**: 197 teaching substeps forward and backward confirmed.\n   - **Offline Execution**: 100% client-side (no cloud or AI APIs).\n\n### Modified Files\n* [`app_build/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/index.html): Dual-row top-bar structure (`top-bar-primary` and `top-bar-secondary`).\n* [`app_build/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css): Tightened gaps, reduced paddings, sticky sidebars, and neutral prediction classes.\n* [`app_build/app.js`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/app.js): `isPredictPending` neutral condition gate rendering and reactive reveal on answer selection.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
